Shaping Europe’s crypto regulatory frameworks.

@Haider, our Global Managing Partner, will join Peter Kerstens, Adviser at DG FISMA, European Commission, for a fireside chat in Paris to discuss MiCA and what comes next. 

We’re building trusted infrastructure for Europe's money markets.

"It doesn't matter if it's on sports, politics or anything else, if it's a validly offered product within a CFTC-regulated exchange, then we regulate that,"  

@ChairmanSelig tells CoinDesk's @nikhileshde for this week's State of Crypto newsletter. 

The CFTC Chair is also speaking at @consensus2026.
